# Pinned llama.cpp source for the ROCm (AMD Strix Halo, gfx1151) llama-server build.
#
# scripts/build-llama-cpp.sh checks out exactly this commit, builds it inside the
# llama-rocm-7rc-rocwmma distrobox, and installs the binary to ~/.local/bin where
# container-start.sh's router picks it up. Bump LLAMA_CPP_REF deliberately to adopt
# new upstream model support (e.g. gemma4 multimodal), then re-run the build script.
#
# Current pin chosen for: Gemma 4 (gemma4) architecture + multimodal mmproj support
# and the re-architected --models-preset router (per-model mmproj). 2026-06-24 upstream.
LLAMA_CPP_REPO=https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp.git
LLAMA_CPP_REF=8be759e6f70d629638a7eb70db3824cbdcea370b
